WEBVTT

00:00:25.696 --> 00:00:29.676
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.534
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:02:18.208 --> 00:02:22.839
I have a question!
What is thy name?

00:02:23.247 --> 00:02:25.147
My name is Spark!

00:02:28.452 --> 00:02:31.513
| am Spark, knight of Flaim!

00:02:42.633 --> 00:02:44.567
Huh? A dream?

00:02:48.071 --> 00:02:51.063
Spark, knight of Flaim...huh?

00:02:55.979 --> 00:02:58.710
Knight... Knight?!

00:03:05.589 --> 00:03:08.923
Sorry! I'm in a hurry!
Outta my way, please!

00:03:08.992 --> 00:03:11.427
Sorry! Excuse me!

00:03:14.031 --> 00:03:15.396
Ow, ow, ow, OW...

00:03:15.465 --> 00:03:18.799
Darn it, Spark!
What's the big rush?!

00:03:18.869 --> 00:03:20.337
Being a knight! A KNIGHT!

00:03:20.404 --> 00:03:22.964
The candidates for knighthood
are announced at the castle today!

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:26.533
Knight? Oh, I see...

00:03:28.212 --> 00:03:30.840
It's gonna be all right!
This year will be different!

00:03:30.914 --> 00:03:34.145
At last, this day has come!
This time...

00:03:34.218 --> 00:03:36.209
...I'm gonna be a knight!

00:03:41.325 --> 00:03:42.815
Everyone, settle down!

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:50.394
Everyone on this list will be
given the formal title of knight...

00:03:50.467 --> 00:03:53.664
...in the service of
King Kashue of Flaim!

00:03:57.641 --> 00:04:00.838
- All right! I made it!
- Yeah!

00:04:10.287 --> 00:04:12.551
My name's not on the list!

00:04:19.129 --> 00:04:22.030
"Time slipped past, slipped past..."

00:04:22.099 --> 00:04:26.627
"..And the boy
grew into a mighty man."

00:04:27.337 --> 00:04:30.102
"And then the man had a dream.
A dream of how.."

00:04:30.173 --> 00:04:32.801
"..He would be a hero
known throughout all Lodoss."

00:04:32.876 --> 00:04:36.176
"Of the day he would be a hero."

00:04:37.281 --> 00:04:42.651
"When his name would be
sung across all of Lodoss..."

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:47.714
"He unleashed his feelings
and became a hero."

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:52.622
"From burning land
and roaring flame..."

00:04:52.696 --> 00:04:56.291
"..And a knight clad in black
did the hero save this land.”

00:04:57.134 --> 00:05:00.126
"With a gentle forest
spirit by his side..."

00:05:02.472 --> 00:05:05.305
"A beautiful lady warrior..."

00:05:09.079 --> 00:05:11.673
"A valiant sorcerer.."

00:05:16.286 --> 00:05:19.984
"A desert king, a wise sage..."

00:05:22.125 --> 00:05:25.356
"The heroes followed
their own paths..."

00:05:25.429 --> 00:05:28.364
"...as time slipped past,
slipped past.”

00:05:28.432 --> 00:05:32.665
"Day after day,
until nine years had passed..."

00:05:52.723 --> 00:05:55.090
Mother.

00:05:58.862 --> 00:06:03.925
"Marfa, mother of the earth.
Goddess who grants all life."

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.866
"Marfa, mother of the earth..."

00:06:05.936 --> 00:06:07.995
Even if you pray to the goddess...

00:06:08.071 --> 00:06:11.063
...you cannot give more life
to one whose time has come.

00:06:11.875 --> 00:06:15.175
That would be an of fense
against nature's law.

00:06:15.512 --> 00:06:16.775
But...

00:06:16.847 --> 00:06:22.911
| was born here in Lodoss
and have had a happy life.

00:06:22.986 --> 00:06:27.150
To live any more than
I have is unnecessary.

00:06:30.293 --> 00:06:32.227
You must be tired
from your long journey.

00:06:32.996 --> 00:06:35.693
You should go to
your room and rest.

00:06:35.766 --> 00:06:38.701
Please let me stay with you!

00:06:38.769 --> 00:06:40.601
Don't worry.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:44.402
| don't have much time left, but
I'll still be here a while longer.

00:06:45.075 --> 00:06:48.705
When the end comes,
you may all be here with me.

00:06:49.646 --> 00:06:53.105
Slayn, forgive me,
but would you remain here?

00:06:58.321 --> 00:07:01.086
What do you wish to tell me?

00:07:01.158 --> 00:07:05.254
| thought it better that
only you hear this.

00:07:05.962 --> 00:07:10.900
You see...
Leylia really isn't my daughter.

00:07:12.969 --> 00:07:14.266
She is...

00:07:14.337 --> 00:07:17.739
Leylia is the reincarnation
of Naneel,

00:07:17.808 --> 00:07:20.470
the high priestess of Kardis.

00:07:22.345 --> 00:07:28.045
Forty years ago, after having
been destroyed by the Six Heroes...

00:07:28.118 --> 00:07:32.248
...the soul of Queen Naneel
called upon Kardis's power...

00:07:32.322 --> 00:07:36.281
...to be reborn into an infant
who lacked the power to resist her.

00:07:37.093 --> 00:07:42.088
I took the cursed child as
my own and named her Leylia.

00:07:42.165 --> 00:07:44.600
| thought that, with the power
of the earth goddess Marfa...

00:07:44.668 --> 00:07:49.196
...I would be able to cleanse
her of the evil soul within.

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:55.444
To my joy, Leylia grew up to
be a great priestess of Marfa.

00:07:55.879 --> 00:08:01.409
Until that terrible accident,
when Karla took control of her...

00:08:05.422 --> 00:08:07.288
Slayn, sage of the North...

00:08:08.291 --> 00:08:11.283
I thank you from
the bottom of my heart.

00:08:11.962 --> 00:08:17.196
Because of her meeting you,
Leylia has been saved in every way.

00:08:21.238 --> 00:08:26.472
From now on,
help her and Little Neese.

00:08:26.543 --> 00:08:30.377
Evil must never be
allowed to control her again...

00:08:31.781 --> 00:08:34.375
| understand.

00:08:35.085 --> 00:08:38.146
It looks like
it's time to say goodbye.

00:08:38.221 --> 00:08:42.783
Look, even my friends have come
to say their final farewells...

00:08:52.903 --> 00:08:58.069
You intend to follow nature's law
and die, high priestess of Marfa?

00:08:58.441 --> 00:09:03.538
| do, source of
chaos on Lodoss...Karla.

00:09:04.014 --> 00:09:06.779
Storm clouds from
the island to the south...

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:10.480
...threaten to
overrun Lodoss once more.

00:09:10.554 --> 00:09:13.922
Knowing that,
will you still pass on?

00:09:14.591 --> 00:09:19.529
Yes... Honestly, what |
want to do is save Lodoss.

00:09:19.596 --> 00:09:22.827
And to save you,
as well. However...

00:09:28.171 --> 00:09:33.701
Now I leave that
task to these children.

00:09:35.278 --> 00:09:37.679
I still believe...

00:09:37.747 --> 00:09:42.583
That against all the chaos
and suffering that you cause...

00:09:42.652 --> 00:09:45.815
...a new hero shall rise.

00:09:45.889 --> 00:09:50.554
And that they will win a
victory for the people of Lodoss...

00:09:56.499 --> 00:10:01.733
"The great priestess of
earth passed on to heaven."

00:10:01.805 --> 00:10:05.173
"And thus was marked
the end of an era.”

00:10:08.345 --> 00:10:10.473
"And the seasons
have passed once more..."

00:10:10.547 --> 00:10:14.575
"..And it has been ten years now
since the battle with the dragon.”

00:10:14.651 --> 00:10:17.382
"And still I pray..."

00:10:18.688 --> 00:10:21.817
"For the heartbeat of
a young hero to ignite."

00:10:21.891 --> 00:10:26.590
"For him to answer Lodoss's
call and set his feelings free."

00:10:27.797 --> 00:10:32.325
The formal title of knight...
When am I gonna get it?!

00:10:34.537 --> 00:10:36.164
Stop that horse-cart!

00:10:36.806 --> 00:10:39.298
Master Spark, please wait!

00:10:41.678 --> 00:10:45.478
What?! I'm invited to a banquet
with King Kashue tonight?!

00:10:45.982 --> 00:10:48.883
Yes, it looks that way,
Master Spark.

00:10:48.952 --> 00:10:51.944
But why me, Count Ruzenan?

00:10:52.022 --> 00:10:53.490
What are you saying?

00:10:53.556 --> 00:10:57.220
You're in line to become leader
of the flame tribe...

00:10:57.293 --> 00:11:01.230
...and could even become a king
one day, so it's only natural.

00:11:02.098 --> 00:11:04.590
Come, come!
King Kashue is waiting for you!

00:11:04.668 --> 00:11:07.660
Please return to castle Akroyd.

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:13.904
King? Become a king?
What's he talking about?

00:11:13.977 --> 00:11:16.969
I'm just a knight in training!

00:11:18.481 --> 00:11:20.381
Master Spark...

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.884
Oh, this is just great!

00:11:21.951 --> 00:11:26.184
I thought King Kashue
didn't care about my lineage!

00:11:32.028 --> 00:11:35.726
There's no way a king would invite
a normal trainee to a banquet.

00:11:36.399 --> 00:11:40.097
Is he calling me in because
I'm related to the tribe chief?

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.036
Well, I'll just say
it straight to him, then!

00:11:42.105 --> 00:11:44.699
I have no intention
of ascending any throne!

00:11:48.078 --> 00:11:50.376
Master Spark, you're here!

00:11:50.447 --> 00:11:54.008
I'll announce you at once!
This way, please!

00:11:54.084 --> 00:11:55.051
| can wait my turn!

00:11:55.118 --> 00:11:57.143
No, but--

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:58.745
That's your job, isn't it?!

00:11:58.822 --> 00:12:01.814
What happens if you let me
cut ahead of everybody?!

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:05.657
Please, just go along with this!

00:12:05.729 --> 00:12:10.223
If Count Ruzenan sees me
holding you back, it'll be my neck!

00:12:10.667 --> 00:12:13.967
Great! I knew this would happen!

00:12:16.172 --> 00:12:18.698
Master Spark has arrived!

00:12:27.150 --> 00:12:29.642
Knight in training
Spark, reporting!

00:12:29.719 --> 00:12:32.711
I hope you're in good
health, King Kashue.

00:12:32.789 --> 00:12:36.225
I heard that you invited me
to a banquet with you, and--

00:12:40.864 --> 00:12:43.799
Forgive me. I'm over here.

00:12:43.867 --> 00:12:45.767
E- Excuse me, King Kashue!

00:12:47.904 --> 00:12:49.998
No matter. It's my fault.

00:12:50.073 --> 00:12:53.475
Don't worry about it. Please,
enough of that. Stand up.

00:12:53.543 --> 00:12:57.446
Highness... Highness, there's
something I have to ask you!

00:12:57.714 --> 00:13:01.878
Was it really your wish that
I be invited to this banquet?

00:13:01.951 --> 00:13:04.784
If it wasn't, then...!

00:13:04.854 --> 00:13:07.619
It most certainly was
my wish that you be invited.

00:13:09.392 --> 00:13:11.121
I'm sure you remember this man.

00:13:11.194 --> 00:13:14.186
| just wanted you to meet
an old friend of yours again.

00:13:15.732 --> 00:13:18.758
It's been a long time, Spark.
Have you been well?

00:13:25.708 --> 00:13:27.836
The free knight... Parn!

00:13:27.911 --> 00:13:30.175
Has it really been ten
years since we last met?

00:13:30.246 --> 00:13:31.270
You've really grown.

00:13:31.347 --> 00:13:36.046
Really. Just turn your back a
moment and humans get so big!

00:13:37.587 --> 00:13:40.557
| thought that
you might want to spar

00:13:40.623 --> 00:13:42.489
with your old hero
after the banquet.

00:13:42.559 --> 00:13:46.120
That's why I called you.
Is there a problem with that?

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:49.028
N- No, sir!

00:13:49.098 --> 00:13:50.463
Oh, my God!

00:13:50.533 --> 00:13:55.869
King Kashue remembers how |
idolized Parn, the free knight!

00:13:55.939 --> 00:14:01.571
THAT'S why he invited me!
And I went and...!

00:14:01.911 --> 00:14:05.347
Well, I've taken up
enough of your time, so--

00:14:05.415 --> 00:14:09.409
One thing, Highness!
I have one thing to ask of you!

00:14:09.485 --> 00:14:10.975
What is it?

00:14:11.054 --> 00:14:14.718
| wish to be part of the force being
sent out to suppress the Marmo!

00:14:17.827 --> 00:14:20.262
Is this the will
of the flame tribe?

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.197
N- No, sir.
It's my own personal wish.

00:14:23.266 --> 00:14:25.496
It has nothing to do
with my people's desires.

00:14:25.568 --> 00:14:27.593
Then I think you're being
a bit presumptuous!

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:29.229
Enough! Now leave us!

00:14:29.305 --> 00:14:31.740
Y- Yes, sir!

00:14:37.113 --> 00:14:39.912
Part of the suppression force
I'm sending to quell the Marmo...

00:14:41.818 --> 00:14:46.187
He doesn't know it, but that's the
exact purpose of your visit, Parn.

00:14:52.262 --> 00:14:55.197
I'm not surprised King
Kashue's angry with me.

00:14:55.265 --> 00:14:59.827
For me, a knight in training,
to ask him something like that...

00:15:15.551 --> 00:15:17.713
Welcome to this dreary room.
I've been waiting for you, Parn.

00:15:17.787 --> 00:15:20.381
Welcome to this dreary room.
I've been waiting for you, Parn.

00:15:21.457 --> 00:15:23.551
Slayn!

00:15:23.626 --> 00:15:25.788
You're looking well, Slayn!

00:15:25.862 --> 00:15:29.958
As do you, Deed. Your beauty
hasn't changed a bit.

00:15:31.734 --> 00:15:34.795
Does being a great sorcerer make
you skilled in flattery as well?

00:15:37.307 --> 00:15:40.242
I haven't seen you since that
fight at Fire Dragon Mountain.

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:44.406
| can't believe it's been ten years
since we were last together.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.986
I've heard about the things you
two have done in the meantime.

00:15:51.054 --> 00:15:53.989
How you've been fighting
with a free army...

00:15:54.057 --> 00:15:56.458
...to recapture Kanon from
Marmo occupied territory.

00:15:56.526 --> 00:15:59.552
Yeah. People from the villages
are finally angry enough...

00:15:59.629 --> 00:16:02.929
...at Marmo's power
that they're rising up.

00:16:02.999 --> 00:16:07.061
One more push and I think
we'll finally have Kanon free!

00:16:07.136 --> 00:16:10.970
Which is why you came here to get
support from Flaim's army, right?

00:16:11.674 --> 00:16:15.838
Why is it you always seem to come
asking favors at inconvenient times?

00:16:15.912 --> 00:16:18.609
You mean what's going
on with Duke Raster?

00:16:18.681 --> 00:16:21.013
News travels quickly
to you, doesn't it?

00:16:21.718 --> 00:16:25.746
It seems certain that, as the
uprising in Alania continues...

00:16:25.822 --> 00:16:28.621
...the Marmo have formed an
alliance with Duke Raster.

00:16:28.691 --> 00:16:32.025
If by any chance Alania falls
under Marmo control...

00:16:32.095 --> 00:16:35.360
...then they will certainly try
some aggression from within...

00:16:35.431 --> 00:16:38.662
...and quickly enlarge their
sphere of influence over Lodoss.

00:16:39.869 --> 00:16:41.860
You're going to attack Raster?

00:16:42.839 --> 00:16:44.603
I have no choice.

00:16:44.674 --> 00:16:47.075
They've ignored Flaim's demands...

00:16:47.143 --> 00:16:50.135
...and now we have to
suppress the Marmo forces.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:53.181
A war with Alania...

00:16:53.249 --> 00:16:56.241
Meaning you can't split your
forces in two now, can you?

00:16:56.819 --> 00:16:59.754
Stopping Duke Raster comes first.

00:16:59.822 --> 00:17:05.556
No matter. As soon as Alania is
beaten, we'll help you out.

00:17:06.295 --> 00:17:07.228
I hope so.

00:17:07.296 --> 00:17:10.960
Until then, the free army
will try to hold out in Kanon.

00:17:11.534 --> 00:17:13.400
By the way, Highness.

00:17:14.103 --> 00:17:17.903
Will you be taking that young
man with you into battle?

00:17:18.207 --> 00:17:21.507
Spark?
Does he interest you?

00:17:21.577 --> 00:17:24.478
Yes. He seems so hotheaded.

00:17:24.547 --> 00:17:27.380
Just looking for trouble,
like Parn used to be.

00:17:29.152 --> 00:17:33.350
| see! But our kingdom has decided
not to take the trainees with us.

00:17:33.923 --> 00:17:38.690
Still, Highness, you should
give some thought to it.

00:17:38.761 --> 00:17:42.129
Are you just going to keep
him in training forever?

00:17:42.198 --> 00:17:43.825
What, now you're doing it?

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:47.200
War changes a person,
either for good or for bad.

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:50.171
Don't you think it's about time
he got some real experience?

00:17:50.239 --> 00:17:53.231
Perhaps... But, Parn...

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:58.714
...I don't want him becoming
a man who just thinks about war.

00:17:59.582 --> 00:18:04.782
| believe he may be essential
for the future of Flaim.

00:18:05.121 --> 00:18:08.113
No... He must be.

00:18:08.758 --> 00:18:12.251
Hey, isn't that Master
Spark over there?

00:18:12.428 --> 00:18:14.726
You want something
inside the treasure house?

00:18:14.797 --> 00:18:17.061
Had enough of the banquet, huh?

00:18:17.133 --> 00:18:20.262
Uh, no. I just
needed to get some air.

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:23.537
So, you had to pull
guard duty today, huh?

00:18:23.606 --> 00:18:25.335
Yeah, no kidding.

00:18:26.042 --> 00:18:28.841
Although, if a little wine slipped
our way, I'd sure welcome it!

00:18:29.545 --> 00:18:31.274
Well, you may make light of this...

00:18:31.347 --> 00:18:34.578
...but you'll be sorry if trouble
comes calling and you're unprepared!

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:36.175
Oh, we're perfectly safe.

00:18:36.252 --> 00:18:41.656
I hear Master Slayn put a spell
on the treasure house to protect it.

00:18:42.191 --> 00:18:43.420
Don't worry about things here.

00:18:43.493 --> 00:18:46.155
Just go back to the banquet
and enjoy yourself, Master Spark.

00:18:46.229 --> 00:18:47.287
Right...

00:18:48.764 --> 00:18:52.598
Thanks, I'll do that.
Sorry to bother you.

00:18:58.841 --> 00:19:01.139
Hey, have some
fun for us, too, okay?!

00:19:05.314 --> 00:19:06.509
<i>W-Hey!</i>

00:19:07.383 --> 00:19:08.748
What happened?!

00:19:21.164 --> 00:19:23.155
A Dark EIf! Marmo?!

00:19:25.735 --> 00:19:28.363
What are the Marmo
doing inside the castle?!

00:19:43.019 --> 00:19:44.111
Welcome...

00:19:44.187 --> 00:19:45.848
...to Lodoss Island!

00:19:45.922 --> 00:19:47.219
And now, what you've
all been waiting for...

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:49.054
...the second part of the show!

00:19:55.264 --> 00:19:56.129
Hi!

00:19:56.199 --> 00:19:57.598
Parn, the free knight!

00:19:57.667 --> 00:20:00.967
You've gotten really big
since I last saw you...

00:20:01.037 --> 00:20:03.267
...knight IN TRAINING Spark!

00:20:03.339 --> 00:20:04.932
I know you didn't get
your title this year again...

00:20:05.007 --> 00:20:07.942
.50 keep trying for NEXT YEAR!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:10.172
Oh, don't be so sad. Cheer up!

00:20:11.047 --> 00:20:13.141
Sure! You'll get it next year!

00:20:13.449 --> 00:20:17.613
Even Parn was EVENTUALLY
able to become a knight.

00:20:18.421 --> 00:20:21.857
Aww... Come on! How many
years do I have to wait?!

00:20:21.924 --> 00:20:25.326
| wanna be a knight right now!

00:20:25.728 --> 00:20:27.696
| wanna be a knight!
| wanna be a knight!

00:20:27.763 --> 00:20:29.288
You think you COULD be one?!

00:20:31.667 --> 00:20:33.465
Give it up, Spark.

00:20:33.536 --> 00:20:36.972
But Highness, please!
Just give me one more chance!

00:20:37.573 --> 00:20:39.974
I'm sorry,
but I make no exceptions!

00:20:40.376 --> 00:20:45.314
Don't say that! You'd make an
exception for ME, wouldn't you?

00:20:47.617 --> 00:20:48.607
Huh?

00:20:48.684 --> 00:20:50.618
Persuasive, isn't he?

00:20:50.686 --> 00:20:53.246
Very well. When you put it
that way, I have no choice.

00:20:53.322 --> 00:20:54.812
It worked!

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:58.155
However, the task I give
you won't be an easy one.

00:20:58.227 --> 00:21:00.696
Yes, sir! I'm ready for anything!

00:21:00.763 --> 00:21:01.559
Very well!

00:21:01.631 --> 00:21:06.034
Anyway, my dear daughter Neese
has some cookies she's baked.

00:21:06.936 --> 00:21:09.064
Will you come with me to
Big Dragon Mountain...

00:21:09.138 --> 00:21:11.300
...to give them
to the Mama Dragon?

00:21:13.509 --> 00:21:14.772
80, let's go, Spark!

00:21:14.844 --> 00:21:16.903
Huh? Cookies?

00:21:16.979 --> 00:21:20.108
Having to assign this
dif ficult task to you...

00:21:20.182 --> 00:21:23.618
Oh, Spark, how it pains me...

00:21:23.686 --> 00:21:27.782
If you pass this test, I just know
you'll become a great knight!

00:21:27.857 --> 00:21:29.382
Yeah, as if!

00:21:30.026 --> 00:21:33.155
Making him the baby sitter is
perfect work for that amateur!

00:22:59.882 --> 00:23:04.080
Before me appears a
suspicious-looking Dark EIf!

00:23:04.687 --> 00:23:07.657
If I beat him, they'll have
to accept me as a knight!

00:23:07.723 --> 00:23:09.851
As I face him alone,
his black daggers

00:23:09.925 --> 00:23:12.121
plunge toward my racing heart!

00:23:14.130 --> 00:23:17.657
Next time, On Record of Lodoss War -
Chronicle of the Heroic Knight:

00:23:18.434 --> 00:23:20.596
"Recovery... A Mission Assigned."
